<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-ST PETERSBURG OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ST PETERSBURG OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $300,000 St Petersburg Open men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Michael Stich (Germany) beat Omar Camporese (Italy)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>8-Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat Nuno Marques (Portugal) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Olivier Delaitre (France) beat 4-Daniel Vacek (Czech) 6-3 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>5-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Stephane Simian (France) 3-6 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
